WEBVTT

NOTE
Descriptions for the PowerCraft08 F-35 Tutorial Video
Student Name: Stephen John Cortez
Section: WD-202
File Name: descriptions.vtt

1
00:00.420 --> 00:05.460
Upbeat music plays at the start of the video.

2
00:05.600 --> 00:12.000
The F-35 tutorial for Plane Crazy begins.

3
00:12.280 --> 00:23.000
The builder places the first part, the motor lock.

4
00:23.560 --> 00:37.000
A propeller is added to the plane.

5
00:37.020 --> 00:51.000
A wing panel and a helium part are placed.

6
01:06.040 --> 01:17.000
A control surface is placed with the green arrow pointing at the bottom.

7
01:29.840 --> 01:53.000
Tiny landing gear and front pontoons are added to the plane.

8
02:02.020 --> 02:17.000
A camera and a trap door are added, with the green arrow at the bottom.

9
02:42.140 --> 03:19.000
The builder selects metal in the materials menu and colors the parts red.

10
03:19.560 --> 04:25.000
The video moves to the controls of the plane.

11
04:25.980 --> 05:38.000
The plane flies while the controls are explained.

12
05:38.360 --> 06:09.000
The builder tries to land the plane.

13
06:09.080 --> 06:15.582
The video ends with upbeat music and a goodbye.